          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "25 general practitioners from across Pakistan, gathered in CIME to learn about updated practices and the latest thinking in infection control and to rehearse clinical scenarios to strengthen skills in Basic Life Support, Suturing, Pathological heart and lung sounds identification and managing Fractures that may present at their clinic. It was a highly interactive day and a good opportunity to network and re-establish old friendships within the group.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
